<title>USA: United Television Q3 shr $1.08 vs $0.65.</title>
<headline>United Television Q3 shr $1.08 vs $0.65.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNITED TELEVISION, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		  CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>	 THIRD QUARTERS AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30,</p>
<p>1996 AND 1995</p>
<p>	     (Unaudited - in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Third Quarter	   Nine Months</p>
<p>			   1996	1995	    1996	 1995</p>
